{"page":550,"verses":[{"verse_key":"60:6","surah":60,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ كَانَ لَكُمْ فِيهِمْ أُسْوَةٌ حَسَنَةٌ لِّمَن كَانَ يَرْجُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱلْيَوْمَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَ ۚ وَمَن يَتَوَلَّ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْغَنِىُّ ٱلْحَمِيدُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Truly, they are a good example for you [believers] to follow, a good example for those who fear God and the Last Day. If anyone turns away, [remember] God is self-sufficing and worthy of all praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(there) is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"in them","transliteration":"fīhim","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُسْوَةٌ","en_gloss":"an example","transliteration":"us'watun","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَسَنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatun","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِّمَن","en_gloss":"for (he) who","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَرْجُوا۟","en_gloss":"hopeful","transliteration":"yarjū","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(in) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawma","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhira","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَتَوَلَّ","en_gloss":"turns away","transliteration":"yatawalla","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","en_gloss":"(is) Free of need","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","en_gloss":"the Praiseworthy","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","verse_key":"60:6"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"60:6"}]},{"verse_key":"60:7","surah":60,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"۞ عَسَى ٱللَّهُ أَن يَجْعَلَ بَيْنَكُمْ وَبَيْنَ ٱلَّذِينَ عَادَيْتُم مِّنْهُم مَّوَدَّةً ۚ وَٱللَّهُ قَدِيرٌ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God may still bring about affection between you and your present enemies- God is all powerful, God is most forgiving and merciful-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ عَسَى","en_gloss":"Perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَجْعَلَ","en_gloss":"will put","transliteration":"yajʿala","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynakum","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَبَيْنَ","en_gloss":"and between","transliteration":"wabayna","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those (to) whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَادَيْتُم","en_gloss":"you have been enemies","transliteration":"ʿādaytum","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْهُم","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّوَدَّةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"mawaddatan","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَدِيرٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Powerful","transliteration":"qadīrun","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"60:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"60:7"}]},{"verse_key":"60:8","surah":60,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"لَّا يَنْهَىٰكُمُ ٱللَّهُ عَنِ ٱلَّذِينَ لَمْ يُقَـٰتِلُوكُمْ فِى ٱلدِّينِ وَلَمْ يُخْرِجُوكُم مِّن دِيَـٰرِكُمْ أَن تَبَرُّوهُمْ وَتُقْسِطُوٓا۟ إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُقْسِطِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and He does not forbid you to deal kindly and justly with anyone who has not fought you for your faith or driven you out of your homes: God loves the just.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنْهَىٰكُمُ","en_gloss":"(does) forbid you","transliteration":"yanhākumu","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُقَـٰتِلُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"fight you","transliteration":"yuqātilūkum","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدِّينِ","en_gloss":"the religion","transliteration":"l-dīni","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُخْرِجُوكُم","en_gloss":"drive you out","transliteration":"yukh'rijūkum","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your homes","transliteration":"diyārikum","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَبَرُّوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you deal kindly","transliteration":"tabarrūhum","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَتُقْسِطُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and deal justly","transliteration":"watuq'siṭū","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"loves","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْمُقْسِطِينَ","en_gloss":"those who act justly","transliteration":"l-muq'siṭīna","verse_key":"60:8"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"60:8"}]},{"verse_key":"60:9","surah":60,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا يَنْهَىٰكُمُ ٱللَّهُ عَنِ ٱلَّذِينَ قَـٰتَلُوكُمْ فِى ٱلدِّينِ وَأَخْرَجُوكُم مِّن دِيَـٰرِكُمْ وَظَـٰهَرُوا۟ عَلَىٰٓ إِخْرَاجِكُمْ أَن تَوَلَّوْهُمْ ۚ وَمَن يَتَوَلَّهُمْ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But God forbids you to take as allies those who have fought against you for your faith, driven you out of your homes, and helped others to drive you out: any of you who take them as allies will truly be wrongdoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنْهَىٰكُمُ","en_gloss":"forbids you","transliteration":"yanhākumu","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَـٰتَلُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"fight you","transliteration":"qātalūkum","verse_key":"60:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","ver